For all k ≥ 0 and i ∈ {0, 1} (the proof treats only these degrees):
- every eigenvalue of T_{p,2} on H^i(X, Ω^{(k,2)}(−D)) ⊗_{Z_p} C has p-adic valuation ≥ 0;
- every eigenvalue of U_{Kli(p),2} on H^i(X_Kli(p), Ω^{(k,2)}(−D)) ⊗_{Z_p} C has p-adic valuation ≥ 0.

